{"session_id": "acceptance42-q06-88ed08fa-e0e0-42d4-9906-f32c9d831d39", "turns": [{"turn_id": "870ac86a80b94879a7ba47136485f783", "created_at": "2026-08-26T03:32:27.706399+00:00", "question": "【42题验收Q06】只看这一张图，能判断它接下来会增强、减弱或者往哪里移动吗？如果不能，还需要什么连续资料？", "answer": "仅凭这一张静态图（384×384 VIL 类回波，最大值238、均值约51.5）**无法**可靠判断风暴接下来会增强、减弱或移动方向。单帧只能看到当前强度与形态，缺少时间演变信息来推断趋势与平流。\n\n![单帧检查图](/api/artifacts/a032b33efe5b43bfa2793508484106e1.png)\n\n要做出短时外推判断，至少还需要：\n1. **连续雷达/SEVIR观测序列**（如前后30–60分钟、5分钟间隔的多帧VIL或反射率），用于计算回波移动矢量、识别合并/分裂与强度变化趋势；\n2. **环境风场/引导气流**（如Aurora ERA5分析或模式预报的低层风），用于校验平流方向并区分系统自传播与环境输送；\n3. 若需定量预测，可进一步调用 **CasCast 集合临近预报**，给出未来1小时多成员概率路径与强度演变。\n\n综上：单图不足以判定增强/减弱/移向，必须补充时序观测与环境风场（或直接使用临近预报产品）才能回答。", "selected_tools": ["ds", "sevir", "geolocator", "cascast", "aurora"], "termination_reason": "agent_completed", "code_execution_count": 1, "evidence_execution_count": 0, "evidence_tool_call_count": 0, "postprocessing_success_count": 1, "tool_cost_summary": {"budget_units": 30.0, "used_units": 0.0, "remaining_units": 30.0, "exhausted": false}, "artifacts": [{"artifact_id": "a032b33efe5b43bfa2793508484106e1", "url": "/api/artifacts/a032b33efe5b43bfa2793508484106e1.png", "image_url": "/api/artifacts/a032b33efe5b43bfa2793508484106e1.png", "title": "Agent生成图", "description": "由本轮生成代码基于真实数据绘制。", "chart_type": "agent_generated", "status": "completed"}], "observations": [{"status": "ok", "result": {"stats": {"shape": [{"type": "int", "omitted": true}, {"type": "int", "omitted": true}], "valid_pixels": 147456, "min": 0.0, "max": 238.0, "mean": 51.536600748697914}, "artifact": "/api/artifacts/a032b33efe5b43bfa2793508484106e1.png"}, "stdout": "Could not save font_manager cache [Errno 13] Permission denied: 'C:\\\\Users\\\\zhaor\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\sevir-session-a6nf2be3\\\\fontlist-v390.json.matplotlib-lock'\n", "available_names": ["arr", "arr_plot", "artifact", "ax", {"omitted_items": 11}, "vals"], "calls": [], "tool_call_summary": {"total": 0, "successful": 0, "failed": 0}, "